{"job_id":"F-29e61e4b3d2ff808ca3d","family_id":"F-29e61e4b3d2ff808ca3d","title":"학술원 사무국에 두는 공무원의 정원 중 고위공무원단 직위의 직무등급의 표시 등에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":50,"target_id":"7584d460180f1302af021af313eb5ae0a3c73d3e15fa21c9de476c27ee2cb4b8","source_hash":"11422914c794ed17f1f8b19cbce24b956f640cbab39f164d35b1df6ca6fa524e","text":"关于国家科学院秘书处高级公务员职位名额评定等规定的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":123,"target_id":"3eac045f8b2b3cce980275f574df7e450fd1dfedacfa2b7cb245253c5f003b2e","source_hash":"106d1d8ff485f9739cdc8ec47ca56dd3e3527041e4a430a3e8367b9814ca51b2","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《科学院秘书处组织结构》规定，对科学院秘书处核定编制的国家公务员中属于高级公务员的普通公务员的职级进行规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":123,"end":259,"target_id":"8ff9a1a781bd41f6572f0f831b076a1d22785d33f9dd5e9334e68cf0b2adaa30","source_hash":"81cdcf33dea0cc8c8644e92bccf84f1160059e3bee7fcbff656af99b2f1a34e2","text":"第二条（高级公务员职级）科学院秘书处职位中，依据《科学院秘书处组织结构》第二条第一款任命的高级公务员担任的秘书处主任，职级为乙级。<2008年12月31日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":259,"end":302,"target_id":"03e5a80db90bad4e5f2dd41fd57d6b0a8c90c889c480e9f4f58c41775d83cda0","source_hash":"4a362e7546220a94b403c68358bcce37e63f2e76a5705ef20a5049384bd138e9","text":"补充规定 <第886号，2006年7月18日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":302,"end":349,"target_id":"1d2d90ff39f6ae39476e3d119d6b7e81b5ba5de2b850bd8495a8de5cd394ab53","source_hash":"8a94cd1730b141b0d12358964d3be741a004e3d181fa4d1f3161220333721a78","text":"增编（教育部、科学技术部及其附属机构组织结构实施细则）<2008年12月31日第24号>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":349,"end":385,"target_id":"6a2ffa9ae95edfa03a8d28d4824688ec861637eb6ae4cdec50df55b0b34ac2c7","source_hash":"53052d208c204533532581bfd7a6e04a15ac8c57efb4df723ae9185d89443bb7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2009年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":385,"end":489,"target_id":"bfeb38bae33ca75c840f1181567b1a34353301c262f4dbc5004f85a5055bfcca","source_hash":"81f494cc8d1bbe313f0a337d0e10780a2d59a08324aa1eeaf8aeadf58c9000ad","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①至⑨ 省略\n\n  10. 对国家科学院秘书处公务员名额中高级公务员职位职级等的指示规则作如下部分修改。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-010255-91010-ko","scope":"BODY","start":489,"end":515,"target_id":"76d7429dab8b4d561db1b6082c66fb12a2201b5ac51a103eb6a5bc9f8b7c91ce","source_hash":"0c8c77ef7dfe4824f293a60ecc92ae9455ef84a0f7dd8b3e52b48a04c6af0be8","text":"  第 2 条中的“E 级”应改为“B 级”。"}]}